hadiths[241]{hadithnumber,text}:
"6742","[AI-translation] Moto huu wenu ambao Wana wa Adam huwasha ni sehemu moja ya sehemu sabini za moto wa Jahannam; nikaambiwa: Ee Mtume wa Mwenyezi Mungu! Je, ulikuwa unatosheleza? Akasema: Hakika huo umezidishwa juu yake kwa sehemu sitini na tisa — zote kama joto lake."
"6743","[AI-translation] Moto huu wenu ni sehemu moja ya sehemu sabini za moto wa Jahannam; kila sehemu humo ina joto lake."
"6744","[AI-translation] Watu wa umma wangu walioneshwa kwangu — wenye kupigana katika njia ya Mwenyezi Mungu, wakipanda mgongo wa bahari hii kama wafalme juu ya viti."
"6745","[AI-translation] Tunaanza na Aliyoanza nayo Mwenyezi Mungu."
"6746","[AI-translation] Wa mwanzo wa umma huu wameokoka kwa yakini na zuhdi; na wa mwisho wake wataangamia kwa ubakhili na matumaini (marefu)."
"6747","[AI-translation] Ondoa udhuru njiani mwa Waislamu."
"6748","[AI-translation] Nimechinja hapa, na Mina yote ni mahali pa kuchinja; basi chinjeneni kwenye makazi yenu; na nimesimama hapa, na Arafa yote ni mahali pa kusimama; na nimesimama hapa, na Muzdalifa yote ni mahali pa kusimama."
"6749","[AI-translation] Sisi ni wa mwisho wa umma na wa kwanza kuhesabiwa; itasemwa: Uko wapi umma usiojua kusoma na Nabii wake? Basi sisi ndio wa mwisho wa mwanzo."
"6750","[AI-translation] Sisi tuna haki zaidi ya shaka kuliko Ibrahim aliposema: (Mola, nionyeshe unavyowahuisha wafu; Akasema: Je, hukuamini? Akasema: Ndiyo, lakini ili utulie moyo wangu); na Mwenyezi Mungu Amrehemu Lut — hakika alikuwa akikimbilia nguzo imara; na lau ningekaa gerezani muda aliokaa Yusuf, ningemwitikia mwenye kuniita."
"6751","[AI-translation] Sisi tuna haki zaidi na tunastahiki zaidi Musa kuliko nyinyi."
"6752","[AI-translation] Sisi ni wa mwisho watanguliao Siku ya Qiyama — isipokuwa wao walipewa Kitabu kabla yetu, nasi tukapewa baada yao; kisha hii ni siku yao Aliyowafaradhishia Mwenyezi Mungu, wakatofautiana humo, Mwenyezi Mungu Akatutuongoa kwayo; basi watu ni wafuasi kwetu humo: Mayahudi kesho na Wakristo kesho kutwa."
"6753","[AI-translation] Sisi ni Wana wa Nadr ibn Kinana: hatumtukani mama yetu wala hatujitoi kwa baba yetu."
"6754","[AI-translation] Sisi tutashuka kesho kwenye Khayf ya Bani Kinana, pale Quraysh walipoahidiana juu ya ukafiri."
"6755","[AI-translation] Mtu ambaye hakufanya kheri kamwe aliondoa tawi la miiba njiani — ima lilikuwa katika mti uliokatwa akalirusha, na ima lilikuwa limewekwa akaliondoa; Mwenyezi Mungu Akamshukuru kwa hilo, Akamwingiza Peponi."
"6756","[AI-translation] Jiwe Jeusi lilishuka kutoka Peponi hali ni jeupe zaidi kuliko maziwa; makosa ya Wana wa Adam yalilifanya liwe jeusi."
"6757","[AI-translation] Jibril aliteremka, akaniswalisha — nikasali pamoja naye, kisha nikasali pamoja naye, kisha nikasali pamoja naye, kisha nikasali pamoja naye, kisha nikasali pamoja naye; kisha akasema: Hivi ndivyo nilivyoamrishwa."
"6758","[AI-translation] Malaika aliteremka kutoka mbinguni na akamkanusha kwa alichokuambia; uliposhinda akaanguka Shetani — nami nisingeketi Shetani anapoanguka."
"6759","[AI-translation] Nabii miongoni mwa Manabii alishuka chini ya mti, mchwa akamwuma; akaamrisha vyombo vyake vikatolewa chini yake, kisha akaamrisha nyumba yake ikachomwa kwa moto; Mwenyezi Mungu Akamfunulia: Mbona si mchwa mmoja?"
"6760","[AI-translation] Aya hii imeteremka kuhusu watu wa Quba: (Humo kuna watu wanaopenda kujitwaharisha, na Mwenyezi Mungu Huwapenda wanaojitwaharisha)."
"6761","[AI-translation] Tunasubiri wala hatuadhibu."
"6762","[AI-translation] Nimenusuriwa kwa (upepo wa) Saba, na Aad wakaangamizwa kwa (upepo wa) Dabur."
"6763","[AI-translation] Mwenyezi Mungu Amuangazie mtu aliyesikia hadithi kutoka kwetu na akaihifadhi mpaka aifikishie kwa mwingine; kwani wapo wabebaji wa fiqhi kwa aliye na fiqhi zaidi kuliko wao, na wapo wabebaji wa fiqhi wasio wanafiqhi."
"6764","[AI-translation] Mwenyezi Mungu Amuangazie mtu aliyesikia kitu kutoka kwetu na akakifikisha kama alivyokisikia; kwani wapo wafikishiwa wenye kuhifadhi zaidi kuliko wasikiao."
"6765","[AI-translation] Mwenyezi Mungu Amuangazie mtumwa aliyesikia maneno yangu na akayaelewa, kisha akayafikisha kutoka kwangu; kwani wapo wabebaji wa fiqhi wasio wanafiqhi, na wapo wabebaji wa fiqhi kwa aliye na fiqhi zaidi kuliko wao."
"6766","[AI-translation] Mwenyezi Mungu Amuangazie mtumwa aliyesikia maneno yangu na akayaelewa na akayahifadhi, kisha akayafikisha kwa asiyeyasikia; kwani wapo wabebaji wa fiqhi wasio wanafiqhi, na wapo wabebaji wa fiqhi kwa aliye na fiqhi zaidi kuliko wao; mambo matatu moyo wa mtu Muislamu haughafil ikiwa nayo: kutakasa amali kwa Mwenyezi Mungu, na kuwanasihi viongozi wa Waislamu, na kushikamana na jamaa yao — kwani hakika dua yao huwakinga nyuma yao."
"6767","[AI-translation] Manii ya mtu ni meupe mazito, na manii ya mwanamke ni ya manjano mepesi; yoyote iliyoshinda mwenzake basi kufanana ni kwake, ... ..."
"6768","[AI-translation] Kitoweo kizuri ni siki."
"6769","[AI-translation] Jihadi njema ni Hijja."
"6770","[AI-translation] Mtu mwema ni Abu Bakr; mtu mwema ni Umar; mtu mwema ni Abu Ubayda ibn al-Jarrah; mtu mwema ni Usayd ibn Hudayr; mtu mwema ni Thabit ibn Qays ibn Shammas; mtu mwema ni Muadh ibn Jabal; mtu mwema ni Muadh ibn Amr ibn al-Jamuh; mtu mwema ni Suhayl ibn Bayda."
"6771","[AI-translation] Mtu mwema ni Abdallah lau angekuwa akisali usiku."
"6772","[AI-translation] Sahur njema ni tende."
"6773","[AI-translation] Sura mbili njema — husomwa katika rakaa mbili kabla ya Alfajiri: (Sema: Enyi makafiri) na (Sema: Yeye Mwenyezi Mungu ni Mmoja)."
"6774","[AI-translation] Sadaka njema ni ngamia mwenye maziwa teule kama kipawa, na kondoo teule kama kipawa — huenda asubuhi na chombo na kurudi jioni na chombo."
"6775","[AI-translation] Kifo kizuri ni mtu afarikie bila haki yake."
"6776","[AI-translation] Mtumwa mwema wa Mwenyezi Mungu ni Khalid ibn al-Walid — upanga miongoni mwa panga za Mwenyezi Mungu."
"6777","[AI-translation] Neema kwa mtwana kufarikiwa hali ni mwema katika ibada ya Mola wake na mnasaha kwa bwana wake — neema kwake."
"6778","[AI-translation] Neema mbili zinadanganywa humo watu wengi: afya na nafasi."
"6779","[AI-translation] Nafsi ya Muumini imening'inizwa na deni lake mpaka lilipwe kwake."
"6780","[AI-translation] Matumizi ya mtu kwa ahali yake ni sadaka."
"6781","[AI-translation] Tunatimiza ahadi yao na tunaomba msaada wa Mwenyezi Mungu dhidi yao."
"6782","[AI-translation] Mito miwili ya Peponi: Naili na Furati."
"6783","[AI-translation] Nimekatazwa kutembea uchi."
"6784","[AI-translation] Nimekatazwa kujifunua."
"6785","[AI-translation] Nimekatazwa (kuwaua) wanaoswali."
"6786","[AI-translation] Nimewakataza vyombo, na hakika vyombo havihalalishi chochote wala haviharamishi; na kila kilicholewesha ni haramu."
"6787","[AI-translation] Nimewakataza nabidh isipokuwa katika kibuyu; basi nyweni katika vibuyu vyote wala msinwye kilicholewesha."
"6788","[AI-translation] Nimewakataza mambo matatu, nami ninawaamrisha nayo: nimewakataza kuzuru makaburi — basi yazuruni, kwani hakika katika kuyazuru kuna ukumbusho; na nimewakataza vinywaji msinywe isipokuwa katika vyombo vya ngozi — basi nyweni katika kila chombo, isipokuwa msinwye kilicholewesha; na nimewakataza nyama za dhabihu msizile baada ya tatu — basi kuleni na jistareheni nazo safarini mwenu."
"6789","[AI-translation] Nimewakataza kuzuru makaburi — basi yazuruni, kwani hakika mna humo mazingatio."
"6790","[AI-translation] Nimewakataza kuzuru makaburi — basi yazuruni, kwani hakika yanawakumbusha mauti."
"6791","[AI-translation] Tumekatazwa kuzungumza katika Swala isipokuwa kwa Qurani na kumtaja (Mwenyezi Mungu)."
"6792","[AI-translation] Mwanamke mwenye kuomboleza asipotubu kabla hajafariki husimamishwa Siku ya Qiyama hali juu yake kuna shati la lami na dirii ya upele."
"6793","[AI-translation] Moto (unaoua bila kukusudia au kwa wanyama) hauna fidia."
"6794","[AI-translation] Moto ni adui — basi uhadharini."
"6795","[AI-translation] Watu hufuata Quraysh katika kheri na shari."
"6796","[AI-translation] Watu ni madini: bora wao katika jahiliyya ni bora wao katika Uislamu wanapokuwa na fiqhi; watu hufuata Quraysh katika jambo hili — Waislamu wao hufuata Waislamu wao na makafiri wao hufuata makafiri wao; mtakuta katika bora wa watu wenye kuchukia zaidi jambo hili mpaka waingie humo."
"6797","[AI-translation] Watu ni madini kama madini ya dhahabu na fedha: bora wao katika jahiliyya ni bora wao katika Uislamu wanapokuwa na fiqhi; na roho ni majeshi yaliyokusanywa — zilozofahamiana hupatana na zilizopingana hutofautiana."
"6798","[AI-translation] Watu ni Wana wa Adam, na Adam anatoka katika udongo."
"6799","[AI-translation] Nabii harithiwi."
"6800","[AI-translation] Nyota ni amani ya mbingu; nyota zinapoondoka mbingu huijia iliyoahidiwa; nami ni amani ya Masahaba zangu; nikienda Masahaba zangu huijia waliyoahidiwa; na Masahaba zangu ni amani ya umma wangu; Masahaba zangu wakienda umma wangu huijia uliyoahidiwa."
"6801","[AI-translation] Makamsi msikitini ni kosa, na kafara yake ni kuyafukia."
"6802","[AI-translation] Majuto ni toba."
"6803","[AI-translation] Majuto ni toba; na mwenye kutubu dhambi ni kama asiye na dhambi."
"6804","[AI-translation] Nadhiri ni za aina mbili: nadhiri katika utii wa Mwenyezi Mungu basi hiyo ni kwa Mwenyezi Mungu, na humo kuna utimilizaji; na nadhiri katika maasi ya Mwenyezi Mungu basi hiyo ni kwa Shetani, wala hapana utimilizaji humo; na huifuta yanayofuta kiapo."
"6805","[AI-translation] Nadhiri ... kafara yake ni kafara ya kiapo."
"6806","[AI-translation] Nusra iko pamoja na subira, na faraji iko pamoja na dhiki; na hakika pamoja na shida kuna nafuu."
"6807","[AI-translation] Ndoa ni Sunna yangu; atakayeacha kufanya Sunna yangu si miongoni mwangu; na oeni, kwani hakika mimi huwazidishia umma Siku ya Qiyama; na mwenye uwezo na aoe; na asiyepata basi juu yake ni funga, kwani hakika funga ni kinga kwake."
"6808","[AI-translation] Usingizi ni ndugu wa mauti, wala watu wa Pepo hawafi."
"6809","[AI-translation] Kuomboleza maiti ni katika mambo ya jahiliyya; na hakika mwanamke mwenye kuomboleza asipotubu kabla hajafariki basi hufufuliwa Siku ya Qiyama hali juu yake kuna mashuka ya lami, kisha huchomwa juu yake kwa dirii za miali ya Moto."
"6810","[AI-translation] Mtume wa Mwenyezi Mungu (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) alikataza jeneza lifuatwe hali pamoja nalo kuna mlio."
"6811","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuta kufunikwa."
"6812","[AI-translation] Alikataza wanyama wafungwe (na kupigwa wakiwa hai)."
"6813","[AI-translation] Alikataza wanawake wasemeshwe isipokuwa kwa idhini ya waume zao."
"6814","[AI-translation] Alikataza kukojoa katika maji yaliyotuama."
"6815","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu kukojoa mahali pake pa kuoga."
"6816","[AI-translation] Alikataza watu kujifakhari katika misikiti."
"6817","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuchukuliwa kitu chenye roho kuwa shabaha."
"6818","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu kujipaka zafarani."
"6819","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuchukuliwa upanga hali umefutuliwa."
"6820","[AI-translation] Alikataza kupumua katika chombo au kupulizia humo."
"6821","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu kuketi baina ya watu wawili isipokuwa kwa idhini yao."
"6822","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu kuketi katika Swala hali ameegemea mkono wake wa kushoto, na akasema: Hakika hiyo ni Swala ya Mayahudi."
"6823","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuketi baina ya jua na kivuli, na akasema: Ni kikao cha Shetani."
"6824","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu kuchanganya jina lake na kunya lake."
"6825","[AI-translation] Alikataza kusafirishwa Qurani kwenye ardhi ya adui."
"6826","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu kujisafisha kwa mfupa au kinyesi au kaa."
"6827","[AI-translation] Alikataza kujisafisha kwa kinyesi au mfupa."
"6828","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuitwa majina manne: Aflah na Yasar na Nafi na Rabah."
"6829","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu kunywa amesimama."
"6830","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu kusali katika shuka asilojifunga nalo, na alikataza mtu kusali katika suruali wala hapana joho juu yake."
"6831","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu kusali hali kichwa chake kimefungwa."
"6832","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu kusali hali anazuia (haja)."
"6833","[AI-translation] Alikataza kusali nyuma ya mwenye kuzungumza na mwenye kulala."
"6834","[AI-translation] Alikataza kusaliwa jeneza baina ya makaburi."
"6835","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu kuweka mguu wake mmoja juu ya mwingine hali amelala chali."
"6836","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu kuwajia ahali yake usiku."
"6837","[AI-translation] Alikataza kutengwa siku ya Ijumaa kwa funga."
"6838","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu asimamishwe kwenye kikao chake na aketi humo mwingine."
"6839","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuuawa chochote cha wanyama kwa kufungwa."
"6840","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu kuketi baina ya kivuli na jua."
"6841","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuketi juu ya kaburi, na kupakwa chokaa au kujengwa juu yake."
"6842","[AI-translation] Alikataza imamu kusimama juu ya kitu hali watu nyuma yake."
"6843","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuandikwa juu ya kaburi chochote."
"6844","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu kugusa tupu yake kwa kulia kwake, na kutembea katika kiatu kimoja, na kujifunga (nguo) kwa kufunga samma, na kujiketisha katika nguo ambayo hapana chochote juu ya tupu yake humo."
"6845","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu kutembea katika kiatu kimoja au khofu moja."
"6846","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuzuiwa ziada ya (maji ya) kisima."
"6847","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu kulala juu ya paa lisilozuiliwa."
"6848","[AI-translation] Alikataza mtu kuvaa viatu hali amesimama."
"6849","[AI-translation] Alikataza kupulizia katika kinywaji, na kunywa penye uliopasuka wa kikombe au sikio lake."
"6850","[AI-translation] Alikataza kupulizia katika chakula na kinywaji, ... ..."
"6851","[AI-translation] Alikataza kukunjwa vinywa vya vibuyu."
"6852","[AI-translation] Alikataza kula kitunguu."
"6853","[AI-translation] Alikataza kula kitunguu na karathi na kitunguu saumu."
"6854","[AI-translation] Alikataza kula kitunguu saumu."
"6855","[AI-translation] Alikataza kula (mnyama) mlafu na maziwa yake?"
"6856","[AI-translation] Alikataza kula dabb."
"6857","[AI-translation] Alikataza kula (mnyama) aliyefungwa - nao ndio wanaofungwa kwa mishale."
"6858","[AI-translation] Alikataza kula kila mwenye meno ya wanyama wa mwituni."
"6859","[AI-translation] Alikataza kula kila mwenye meno ya wanyama wa mwituni na kula mwenye kucha za ndege."
"6860","[AI-translation] Alikataza kula nyama za punda wa kufugwa."
"6861","[AI-translation] Alikataza kupunguza (nguzo) katika Swala."
"6862","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuhasiwa."
"6863","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuunganisha (tende) isipokuwa mtu amuombe ruhusa nduguye."
"6864","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuketi kwa iqaa katika Swala."
"6865","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuketi kwa iqaa na kutawarruk katika Swala."
"6866","[AI-translation] Alikataza kula na kunywa katika chombo cha dhahabu na fedha."
"6867","[AI-translation] Alikataza kujiepusha na wanawake (kutokuoa)."
"6868","[AI-translation] Alikataza kujikusanyia mali (kwa tamaa)."
"6869","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuvaa pete ya dhahabu."
"6870","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuchana (nywele) isipokuwa mara moja baada ya nyingine."
"6871","[AI-translation] Alikataza kujigharimu kwa mgeni."
"6872","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuvuna (matunda) usiku na kuvuna (nafaka) usiku."
"6873","[AI-translation] Alikataza kubishana katika Qurani."
"6874","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuketi kwenye meza ambayo hunywewa humo pombe, na mtu ale hali amelala kifudifudi."
"6875","[AI-translation] Alikataza (mnyama) mlafu apandwe au kunywewa maziwa yake."
"6876","[AI-translation] Alikataza kujiketisha siku ya Ijumaa hali imamu anahutubu."
"6877","[AI-translation] Alikataza kurusha kokoto, na akasema: Hakika hizo haziuwi mawindo wala hazimdhuru adui, lakini hutoboa jicho na huvunja jino."
"6878","[AI-translation] Alikataza dawa mbaya."
"6879","[AI-translation] Alikataza dibaj na hariri na istabraq."
"6880","[AI-translation] Alikataza ruqya (za kishirikina) na hirizi na uchawi wa mapenzi."
"6881","[AI-translation] Alikataza kupandwa ngozi za chui."
"6882","[AI-translation] Alikataza uongo."
"6883","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuachia (nguo) katika Swala na mtu afunike mdomo wake."
"6884","[AI-translation] Alikataza ... kuchinja wenye maziwa."
"6885","[AI-translation] Alikataza kununua na kuuza msikitini, na kutangazwa humo kipotee, na kutungwa humo mashairi; na alikataza kukusanyika kabla ya Swala siku ya Ijumaa."
"6886","[AI-translation] Alikataza kunywa katika vyombo vya dhahabu na fedha, na alikataza kuvaa dhahabu na hariri, na alikataza ngozi za chui zipandwe."
"6887","[AI-translation] Alikataza kunywa amesimama, ... ..."
"6888","[AI-translation] Alikataza kunywa penye uliopasuka wa kikombe na kupulizia katika kinywaji."
"6889","[AI-translation] Alikataza kunywa mdomoni mwa kibuyu."
"6890","[AI-translation] Alikataza kunywa mdomoni mwa kibuyu na kupanda (mnyama) mlafu na (mnyama) aliyefungwa."
"6891","[AI-translation] Alikataza shighar."
"6892","[AI-translation] Alikataza Swala baada ya Alfajiri mpaka jua lichomoze na baada ya Alasiri mpaka lichomoze."
"6893","[AI-translation] Alikataza Swala kuelekea makaburi."
"6894","[AI-translation] Alikataza (kuvaa) samma na kujiketisha katika nguo moja."
"6895","[AI-translation] Alikataza picha."
"6896","[AI-translation] Alikataza kucheka kwa sababu ya shuto."
"6897","[AI-translation] Alikataza kujichoma moto."
"6898","[AI-translation] Alikataza mutaa."
"6899","[AI-translation] Alikataza mthla."
"6900","[AI-translation] Alikataza muhaqala na mukhasara na mulamasa na munabadha na muzabana."
"6901","[AI-translation] Alikataza mukhabara."
"6902","[AI-translation] Alikataza muzabana."
"6903","[AI-translation] Alikataza muzabana na muhaqala."
"6904","[AI-translation] Alikataza muzaraa."
"6905","[AI-translation] Alikataza (kuvaa nguo) iliyotiwa zafarani."
"6906","[AI-translation] Alikataza munabadha na mulamasa."
"6907","[AI-translation] Alikataza (kutumia) matandiko mekundu na upinde."
"6908","[AI-translation] Alikataza tandiko la rangi ya zambarau."
"6909","[AI-translation] Alikataza najsh."
"6910","[AI-translation] Alikataza nadhiri."
"6911","[AI-translation] Alikataza kutangaza kifo."
"6912","[AI-translation] Alikataza kupulizia katika kinywaji."
"6913","[AI-translation] Alikataza kupulizia katika chakula na kinywaji."
"6914","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuomboleza ... na picha na ngozi za wanyama wa mwituni, na kujionyesha na kuimba na dhahabu na (kitambaa cha) khazz na hariri."
"6915","[AI-translation] Alikataza kulala kabla ya Isha na kuzungumza baada yake."
"6916","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuomboleza."
"6917","[AI-translation] Alikataza uporaji na mthla."
"6918","[AI-translation] Alikataza uporaji na unyakuzi."
"6919","[AI-translation] Alikataza upweke: mtu alale peke yake."
"6920","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuchoma alama usoni na kupiga usoni."
"6921","[AI-translation] Alikataza tatoo."
"6922","[AI-translation] Alikataza wisal (kuunganisha funga)."
"6923","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuuza matunda mpaka yaokoke na uharibifu."
"6924","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuuza matunda mpaka wema wake udhihiri na aaminiwe na uharibifu."
"6925","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuuza matunda mabichi kwa tende kavu."
"6926","[AI-translation] Alikataza kuuza matunda mabichi kwa tende kavu kwa kipimo, na kuuza zabibu kwa zabibu kavu kwa kipimo, na kuuza mimea kwa ngano kwa kipimo."
